    "description": "<br><div><span style=\"font-family: verdana\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px\"> </span></span>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif\">Key Responsibilities Include:<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0in\" type=\"disc\">\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Frontline Communication: Serve as the first point of contact for patients, visitors, and staff, answering phones, directing inquiries, and managing patient flow.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Patient Registration: Handle patient admissions, inputting personal information, and updating medical records.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Documentation: Maintain accurate and up-to-date patient charts, ensuring all forms and orders are properly filed and accessible.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Coordination: Assist in coordinating communication between physicians, nurses, and other healthcare team members, ensuring timely delivery of care.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Ordering Supplies and Equipment: Monitor and manage office and medical supply inventory, placing orders as needed.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:\"Aptos Narrow\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"\">Monitoring Patient Status: Update patient information, track room assignments, and communicate patient progress to the team.<b><o:p></o:p></b></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>",
