    "description": "<br><h1 data-end=\"183\" data-start=\"134\"><strong data-end=\"181\" data-start=\"136\">Med Surg Nursing Manager &ndash; Georgetown, TX</strong></h1>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"184\"><strong data-end=\"197\" data-start=\"184\">Schedule:</strong> Full-time &bull; Days (No Weekends)<br />\r\n<strong data-end=\"2164\" data-start=\"2151\">Location:</strong> Georgetown, TX<br data-end=\"2182\" data-start=\"2179\" />\r\n<strong data-end=\"2202\" data-start=\"2182\">Employment Type:</strong> Permanent, Full-Time</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"232\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"264\" data-start=\"237\"><strong data-end=\"262\" data-start=\"241\">Position Overview</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"265\">We are seeking a highly motivated <strong data-end=\"327\" data-start=\"299\">Med Surg Nursing Manager</strong> to lead a dynamic medical-surgical team in Georgetown, TX. This position offers a unique opportunity to oversee a 45-bed unit, guiding nursing staff and collaborating with leadership to ensure exceptional patient care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"637\" data-start=\"550\">The role includes <strong data-end=\"593\" data-start=\"568\">relocation assistance</strong> and a <strong data-end=\"634\" data-start=\"600\">sign-on bonus of up to $15,000</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"642\" data-start=\"639\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"674\" data-start=\"644\"><strong data-end=\"672\" data-start=\"648\">Key Responsibilities</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"675\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"675\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"677\">Provide leadership, supervision, and direction for nursing staff in the Med Surg unit.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"766\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"768\">Collaborate with physicians, directors, and healthcare teams to deliver high-quality patient care.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"869\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"937\" data-start=\"871\">Assign and manage staff based on patient needs and competencies.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"938\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"940\">Conduct staff evaluations, resolve conflicts, and enforce compliance with hospital policies.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1035\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1037\">Monitor unit performance, quality measures, and patient outcomes.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1105\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1187\" data-start=\"1107\">Maintain strong communication channels with staff, physicians, and leadership.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1188\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1190\">Step in as a hands-on leader when direct patient care support is needed.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1269\" data-start=\"1266\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1295\" data-start=\"1271\"><strong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1275\">Qualifications</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1296\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1296\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1298\"><strong data-end=\"1331\" data-start=\"1298\">Registered Nurse (RN) license</strong> in Texas (or compact state).</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1420\" data-start=\"1363\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1420\" data-start=\"1365\"><strong data-end=\"1418\" data-start=\"1365\">BSN from an accredited nursing school (required).</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1455\" data-start=\"1421\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1455\" data-start=\"1423\">Current <strong data-end=\"1453\" data-start=\"1431\">BLS certification.</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1456\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1458\"><strong data-end=\"1495\" data-start=\"1458\">2+ years of healthcare experience</strong> (leadership experience preferred).</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1533\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1535\">Strong leadership, communication, and problem-solving skills.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1603\" data-start=\"1600\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1638\" data-start=\"1605\"><strong data-end=\"1636\" data-start=\"1609\">Compensation &amp; Benefits</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1639\">\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1695\" data-start=\"1639\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1695\" data-start=\"1641\">Salary up to <strong data-end=\"1666\" data-start=\"1654\">$113,000</strong> (depending on experience).</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1732\" data-start=\"1696\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1732\" data-start=\"1698\"><strong data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1698\">Sign-on bonus up to $15,000.</strong></p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1769\" data-start=\"1733\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1769\" data-start=\"1735\">Relocation assistance available.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1770\">\r\n\t<p data-end=\"1835\" data-start=\"1772\">Comprehensive health, retirement, and paid time off benefits.</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-end=\"1840\" data-start=\"1837\" />\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1866\" data-start=\"1842\"><strong data-end=\"1864\" data-start=\"1846\">Why This Role?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p data-end=\"2144\" data-start=\"1867\">This is an opportunity to take on a leadership position in a supportive environment where your expertise will directly impact patient outcomes and staff development. You&rsquo;ll enjoy career growth, competitive compensation, and the satisfaction of guiding a strong Med Surg team.</p>\r\n<br>",
